Lakṣmaṇa vows killing false Sugrīva and crowning Aṅgada --- Rāma restrains leaping Lakṣmaṇa enjoining gentle speech --- Lakṣmaṇa rushes felling trees and shattering rocks --- Lakṣmaṇa sees thronged Kiṣkindhā as monkeys seize peaks --- Terrified monkeys flee and report anger to Sugrīva --- Lust-bound Sugrīva with Tārā ignores heroes words --- Ministers send dread nail-tooth monkeys from city --- Lakṣmaṇa smokes red-eyed snakelike as Aṅgada despairs --- Aṅgada announces Lakṣmaṇa arrival at door --- Plakṣa Prabhāva propitiate Sugrīva urging pact-keeping
